02_overlays/PROMPT_evaluation_monitoring_overlay.md:1237:- preserve host-runtime carryover and packet-family completeness as release-relevant integrity dimensions
02_overlays/PROMPT_evaluation_monitoring_overlay.md:1238:- preserve control-loop packet parity and guide / runtime / skill lookup parity as release-relevant integrity dimensions
